<DocsLayout
  title="alert-notify Documentation — Astro"
  description="Use alert-notify in Astro with a client script or framework island. Recipe only: same core API, no dedicated Astro adapter."
  pageTitle="Astro"
>
  <p>
    <span class="tier recipe">Recipe</span>
    Use a client script or island. Same imperative API as vanilla JS. No dedicated Astro adapter.
  </p>

  <pre class="api"><code>{`---
// client script or framework island
---
<script>
  import { toast } from "alert-notify";
  document.querySelector("button")?.addEventListener("click", () => {
    toast.success("Saved");
  });
</script>`}</code></pre>
